	(text "GPIO map: GP0/GP1 = UART0 (JST Pin1/Pin2, reserved) | GP2-5 = buttons R,B,G,Y (pull-up, press = GND) | GP6-9 = LED drivers R,B,G,Y (HIGH = lit) | GP10 = status LED (HIGH = lit)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a3d980bc-226d-40d1-921e-3cca044dac1d")
	)
	(text "LED drive: anode -> resistor -> +5V (VSYS), cathode -> 2SC1815 collector, emitter -> GND. Blue/green Vf = 3.1-3.3V, so a 3.3V GPIO cannot drive them directly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 19.05 0)
		(effects
